  ('72e02a1f-c745-5c8e-8acf-a6ca68db5102', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g6-theme-summary'), null, 'easy',
   $q$Which choice is the best objective summary of the story?$q$, $q$[{"text":"At a meet, Rafael's jump is measured as a school record, but he points out that his hand landed closer, so the jump is remeasured and he misses the record.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Rafael is the most honest athlete at his school, and the official was careless to miss the handprint.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"},{"text":"Rafael breaks the school record at the district meet, and his teammates cheer for him.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-ending"},{"text":"Rafael falls back on his last jump and catches himself with one hand behind his heels.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$At a meet, Rafael's jump is measured as a school record, but he points out that his hand landed closer, so the jump is remeasured and he misses the record.$q$, $q$The correct summary includes the mismeasured jump, Rafael's report and the result. The cheering happens before the remeasure, and in the end Rafael does not hold the record.$q$, 'draft', '5b05a701-5743-55e6-85f7-85d5889a54ef')
