   $q$Which choice is the best objective summary of the story?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Amara ignores Joon's idea for a solar oven, the oven fails, and when she finally tries his idea, the chocolate melts and she wants to hear more from him.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Amara and Joon build a solar oven together and win first place in the class contest.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"adds-false-detail"},{"text":"Joon draws a sketch of a foil flap and keeps it folded in his pocket.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Amara is bossy and unfair to Joon, and she deserves to lose the contest.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Amara ignores Joon's idea for a solar oven, the oven fails, and when she finally tries his idea, the chocolate melts and she wants to hear more from him.$q$, $q$The correct summary covers the ignored idea, the failure, the second try and Amara's change. The story clearly says "They did not win," so the choice saying they "win first place" adds a false result.$q$, 'draft', '1c4b0c21-cdcc-54b9-9ab5-b272f28ef127')
