  ('6b35f101-9b78-5af4-bd61-b709c9ddb6aa', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g6-theme-summary'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Which choice is the best objective summary of the story?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Lucia is unhappy to be placed in second violin, but after hearing how the harmony supports the melody, she works hard and takes pride in her part.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Lucia should have been placed in first violin, and Mr. Adeyemi made an unfair choice.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"},{"text":"Lucia moves up to the first violin section and plays the melody at the spring concert.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"adds-false-detail"},{"text":"Lucia is disappointed when her best friend, Hana, is placed in the first violin section.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Lucia is unhappy to be placed in second violin, but after hearing how the harmony supports the melody, she works hard and takes pride in her part.$q$, $q$The correct summary includes her disappointment, the lesson at rehearsal and her change. Her disappointment over the list is only the beginning, so the choice that stops at her disappointment leaves out how the story develops.$q$, 'draft', 'bd979aea-5281-595d-9d5a-52b19c1e442b')
