   $q$Why does the author include the detail that Kofi "thought about how he had sighed inside the house"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To show that Kofi was feeling sick and needed to rest on the porch.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"To show Kofi realizing he had been less patient with his grandfather than his grandfather was with him.","is_correct":true},{"text":"To explain that Kofi's mother had asked him to keep his feelings to himself.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"To suggest that Kofi plans to stop teaching his grandfather after today.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To show Kofi realizing he had been less patient with his grandfather than his grandfather was with him.$q$, $q$Right before this, the text calls his grandfather "a patient teacher," so Kofi compares himself and sees his own impatience. Nothing suggests he will stop teaching, and the ending shows the lessons worked.$q$, 'draft', '270a4759-817f-556e-8b32-3e16408a46b5')
