  ('d3463d42-af97-5c1e-bd90-eb2253321396', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g7-argument-evidence'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Which statement best evaluates the evidence from Linwood Middle School?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It is irrelevant, because Linwood is in a different town from Redfern.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misjudges-relevance"},{"text":"It proves that Redfern will soon grow enough lettuce to fill a salad bar of its own.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralizes"},{"text":"It is weak, because it is about lettuce and the argument is only about trash.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"mismatched-reason"},{"text":"It shows composting can work at a school, but one school's results may not match Redfern's.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It shows composting can work at a school, but one school's results may not match Redfern's.$q$, $q$Linwood's success is relevant support for the soil reason, but a single example cannot prove Redfern will get the same result. Calling it proof goes further than one school's experience allows.$q$, 'draft', '44f71698-e636-585c-aa57-1581e5df4808')
