   $q$What claim did the supporters make at the meeting?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Calder Falls should buy a bigger ferry for the harvest season.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Calder Falls should spend less money for the next three years.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-counterclaim"},{"text":"Calder Falls should build an iron bridge across the river.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Calder Falls should charge a toll to ride the existing ferry.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-outcome-claim"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Calder Falls should build an iron bridge across the river.$q$, $q$The first paragraph says shop owners "proposed building an iron bridge," and their three points all support that idea. The toll was the town's later plan for paying for the bridge, not the supporters' claim.$q$, 'draft', '97bbbdaf-e60f-5c37-a446-17680f7cbadf')
