   $q$How does the last sentence of the passage connect to the parents' worry in paragraph 2?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It suggests the parents were correct, since players struggled when they moved to larger fields.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It suggests the worry did not matter, since players quit before they reached the larger fields.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It suggests the small games did prepare players, since they later handled the ball with more confidence.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It suggests the parents changed the league, since they asked for bigger fields at age eleven.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It suggests the small games did prepare players, since they later handled the ball with more confidence.$q$, $q$Parents feared the small games "would not prepare children for real soccer," but the passage ends by saying those players handled the ball "with more confidence than earlier groups." Fewer children quit, not more, so the choice saying "players quit before they reached the larger fields" is unsupported.$q$, 'draft', 'f64504c5-9200-5e07-854d-da0754dd1b31')
