   $q$What can the reader infer about why beavers were trapped or removed in many areas?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Scientists had proven that beaver ponds harmed the birds living near streams.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Beavers had started attacking farm animals that grazed near their ponds.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"People saw the flooding and tree damage as problems and did not yet know about the benefits.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Beavers had stopped building dams and were no longer useful to anyone.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$People saw the flooding and tree damage as problems and did not yet know about the benefits.$q$, $q$Paragraph 2 names flooding and chewed trees as reasons people saw dams as a nuisance, and paragraph 3 says scientists only "now" see the benefits. The bird study actually found more kinds of birds near ponds, so the choice "Scientists had proven that beaver ponds harmed the birds living near streams" contradicts the text.$q$, 'draft', '0f15e3de-08ef-5e31-bf53-4231f29ae673')
