   $q$What does the passage suggest about how the students handled the problem with the temperature readings?$q$, $q$[{"text":"They decided that cloudy weather was the cause and ignored the cloudy afternoons.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"They looked for a physical cause near the station and tested a fix by moving it.","is_correct":true},{"text":"They asked the airport staff to explain why the afternoon readings kept jumping.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"They threw out all of their early data and started again with a brand new kit.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$They looked for a physical cause near the station and tested a fix by moving it.$q$, $q$Darnell noticed the vent near the station, and the club moved the station, after which the jumps stopped. The text never mentions a new kit or contact with the airport staff.$q$, 'draft', '002f5543-056f-5f8d-bde8-04237c0a3b55')
